Rules:
- Each `>>>FILE: <path>` line starts a new file; everything until the next `>>>ENDFILE` line is that file's exact content.
- Do NOT escape anything — no `\n`, no `\"`, no backslash-escaping of any kind. Write the code exactly as it should appear in the file.
